WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.451
SURE WE GET THIS INFORMATION WE

00:00:03.482 --> 00:00:07.686
NEED IN A TIMELY MANNER.

00:00:05.584 --> 00:00:08.988
&gt;&gt;  CONGRESSMAN, THANK YOU FOR

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:12.825
JOINING US TONIGHT.

00:00:09.121 --> 00:00:15.527
HERE WITH REACTION, OUR TWO

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:19.131
ESTEEMED ATTORNEY.

00:00:15.661 --> 00:00:20.165
AN AUTHOR OF THE NEW BOOK

00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:22.334
"TRUMPED UP."

00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:25.704
GREAT TO SEE BOTH OF YOU.

00:00:22.468 --> 00:00:28.607
JUDGE ELLIS, YOU KNOW HIM WELL.

00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:31.944
I KNOW HIM WELL FROM A LONG TIME

00:00:28.741 --> 00:00:34.380
AGO WHEN I WAS A LITIGATOR.

00:00:32.077 --> 00:00:34.680
HE'S AN INCREDIBLY TALENTED

00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:36.048
JUDGE.

00:00:34.813 --> 00:00:36.448
SENIOR JUDGE ON THE EASTERN

00:00:36.181 --> 00:00:39.051
DISTRICT.

00:00:36.582 --> 00:00:45.124
HE JUST LAID INTO THE SPECIAL

00:00:39.184 --> 00:00:48.427
COUNSEL'S OFFICE.

00:00:45.257 --> 00:00:50.129
HE SAID, "I DON'T SEE WHAT

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.364
RELATIONSHIP THIS INDICTMENT HAS

00:00:50.262 --> 00:00:54.366
AGAINST MANAFORT WITH ANYTHING

00:00:52.498 --> 00:00:55.968
THE SPECIAL COUNSEL IS

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.370
AUTHORIZED TO INVESTIGATE.

00:00:56.101 --> 00:01:00.272
IT'S UNLIKELY YOU'RE GOING TO

00:00:58.504 --> 00:01:03.142
PERSUADE ME THE SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:01:00.406 --> 00:01:06.111
HAS THIS UNFETTERED POWER TO DO

00:01:03.275 --> 00:01:06.545
WHATEVER YOU WANT."

00:01:06.245 --> 00:01:06.362
&gt;&gt;

00:01:06.362 --> 00:01:10.349
&gt;

00:01:06.679 --> 00:01:13.052
&gt;&gt;THEY'RE GOING AFTER PEOPLE

00:01:10.482 --> 00:01:14.720
LIKE MANAFORT AND FLYNN AND COHN

00:01:13.185 --> 00:01:16.322
BECAUSE THEY WANT TO FLIP THEM.

00:01:14.853 --> 00:01:19.258
THEY WANT TO MAKE THEM SING.

00:01:16.455 --> 00:01:20.693
AS THE JUDGE PUT IT IN THEIR

00:01:19.391 --> 00:01:21.026
STATEMENT, MAYBE EVEN MAKE THEM

00:01:20.826 --> 00:01:23.362
COMPOSE.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.696
I THINK I CAME UP WITH THAT

00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:27.800
PHRASE.

00:01:23.829 --> 00:01:28.901
COMPOSING INSTEAD OF SINGING.

00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:31.070
THE ONLY DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THIS

00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:33.872
JUDGE AND OTHER JUDGES IS THIS

00:01:31.203 --> 00:01:34.206
JUDGE IS COMPLETELY AND TOTALLY

00:01:34.006 --> 00:01:37.176
HONEST.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:38.510
HE CALLS IT THE WAY HE SEES IT.

00:01:37.309 --> 00:01:38.977
THE AMAZING THING IS HE CALLED

00:01:38.644 --> 00:01:40.713
HIM ON IT.

00:01:39.111 --> 00:01:42.147
HE SAID, "YOU CAN'T DO THAT IF

00:01:40.846 --> 00:01:44.350
YOU'RE A SPECIAL COUNSEL.

00:01:42.281 --> 00:01:45.751
YOU HAVE TO GO AFTER DIRECTLY

00:01:44.483 --> 00:01:46.085
THE EVIDENCE THAT'S WITHIN YOUR

00:01:45.884 --> 00:01:48.887
MANDATE.

00:01:46.218 --> 00:01:52.091
YOU CAN'T BE FINDING PEOPLE,

00:01:49.021 --> 00:01:54.093
CREATING OR EXAGGERATING OR

00:01:52.224 --> 00:01:56.528
COMING UP WITH CRIMES, NOT IN

00:01:54.226 --> 00:01:57.629
ORDER TO GET THOSE PEOPLE BUT IN

00:01:56.662 --> 00:01:59.631
ORDER TO SQUEEZE THEM AND GET

00:01:57.763 --> 00:02:02.634
THEM TO SING AND COMPOSE."

00:01:59.765 --> 00:02:03.669
IT'S ABOUT TIME A JUDGE HONESTLY

00:02:02.768 --> 00:02:04.803
LOOKED AT THE SITUATION AND

00:02:03.802 --> 00:02:06.105
ASSESSED IT.

00:02:04.937 --> 00:02:07.139
YOU AND I HAVE BEEN TALKING

00:02:06.238 --> 00:02:09.375
ABOUT THIS NOW FOR MONTHS.

00:02:07.272 --> 00:02:10.843
WE SHOULDN'T BE SURPRISED.

00:02:09.508 --> 00:02:12.411
BUT IT'S SURPRISING AND

00:02:10.976 --> 00:02:13.912
REFRESHING THAT A FEDERAL JUDGE

00:02:12.544 --> 00:02:17.449
WOULD SAY THAT.

00:02:14.046 --> 00:02:19.051
WHY DID MUELLER TAKE THIS CASE

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:21.153
OUT OF VIRGINIA AND TRY TO PUT

00:02:19.184 --> 00:02:24.490
IT IN WASHINGTON, D.C.?

00:02:21.286 --> 00:02:28.694
BECAUSE HE KNOWS THAT HE WOULD

00:02:24.623 --> 00:02:30.195
GET MORE POSITIVE JUDGES AND

00:02:28.827 --> 00:02:31.964
JURORS IN THE DISTRICT OF

00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:35.834
COLUMBIA THAN VIRGINIA.

00:02:32.097 --> 00:02:37.669
IN VIRGINIA HE'S GOING TO GET

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:38.036
JUDGES LIKE THIS WHO ARE

00:02:37.803 --> 00:02:39.872
STRAIGHT.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.572
AND SO CLEARLY THAT WAS JUDGE

00:02:40.005 --> 00:02:42.708
SHOPPING AND JURY SHOPPING.

00:02:40.706 --> 00:02:44.910
WHEN I SAID THAT, I WAS CALLED A

00:02:42.841 --> 00:02:46.612
RACIST AND CONDEMN.

00:02:45.043 --> 00:02:48.113
CONGRESSMAN CONDEMNED ME.

00:02:46.745 --> 00:02:48.914
BUT I THINK THIS OPINION

00:02:48.247 --> 00:02:50.883
VINDICATES WHAT I'VE BEEN SAYING

00:02:49.047 --> 00:02:54.653
FOR A LONG TIME.

00:02:51.016 --> 00:03:01.493
&gt;&gt;  WE DO HAVE ANOTHER ASPECT OF

00:02:54.787 --> 00:03:02.694
THE CASE THAT'S STILL IN D.C. I

00:03:01.627 --> 00:03:06.565
THINK WE LOST HIM.

00:03:02.828 --> 00:03:08.367
IF WE GET HIM BACK, LET ME KNOW.

